ens of dimensions ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":") are used so as to keep consistancy beweetn Figma specifications and library for developers."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemesizesemantictokensprovider","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSizeSemanticTokensProvider"}}}